31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! Did anyone have any spooky dreams?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I slept well, thank you. I'm a bit nervous about today's vote.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Let's get this over with. Does anyone have any leads?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Actually, I do! I'm the Seer, and I checked Takumi. He's the werewolf!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A claim on the very first day. That is an incredibly aggressive move, Mio.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,What?! Takumi is the wolf? No way! He looks too brave for that!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minato,,"Oh dear... are you sure, Mio? That's a very big accusation.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Takumi,,You've got to be kidding me! I'm a villager! Mio is lying to frame me!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm not lying! The divination was clear as day!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, why reveal yourself so early? It makes you a target for the wolf tonight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Maybe Mio is the werewolf and she's just trying to trick us!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
