43,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Exactly! Don't listen to her. She's trying to get rid of me because I'm a threat!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm telling the truth! If you don't vote Takumi now, he'll just kill us all!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"If Mio is the Seer, the game ends now. If she's the wolf, we lose a villager.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm still not sure... but Mio seems so confident!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll trust Mio. She's always so honest.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
